{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828800/extras/a418e016afdedac3f231259ab1af963d.poster.avif?t=1765321902\" width=616 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828800/extras/a418e016afdedac3f231259ab1af963d.webm?t=1765321902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828800/extras/a418e016afdedac3f231259ab1af963d.mp4?t=1765321902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinball Blitz</strong> combines <strong>arcade pinball</strong> with a fast-paced <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong>. Shape each run with powerful spell cards and table upgrades to <strong>defeat bosses</strong> and <strong>achieve high-scores</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Spell Decks</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a deck that offers a  variety of starting spell cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These decks aim at different strategies and offer interesting ways to approach enemies and bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards will inherently have synergy with each other - creating the perfect spell deck is a skill only held by true pinball wizards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Upgrades </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies will lead you to several choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you add a new spell to your deck? Drink a potion that changes how certain spells interact? Navigate to the boss fight early?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades range from multiball to guided rockets - new combinations add to a chaotic run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","background":