l inherently have synergy with each other - creating the perfect spell deck is a skill only held by true pinball wizards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Upgrades </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies will lead you to several choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you add a new spell to your deck? Drink a potion that changes how certain spells interact? Navigate to the boss fight early?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades range from multiball to guided rockets - new combinations add to a chaotic run.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","developers":["devindoubt"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828800/header.jpg?t=1765321902","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Pinball Blitz","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 540<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["devindoubt"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"re